{"id":"vermo_gen","lemma":"Vermögen","pos":"noun","rank":1762,"glosses":["ability, capacity","fortune (lots of riches), wealth"],"ipa":"/fɛʁˈmøːɡn̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1b/De-Verm%C3%B6gen.ogg/De-Verm%C3%B6gen.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Vermögens","plural":"Vermögen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich möchte sehen, was Sie vermögen.","en":"I'd like to see what you're capable of.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null]},{"text":"Es kostet ein Vermögen.","en":"It costs an arm and a leg.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to cost","l":"kosten"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Das kostete uns ein Vermögen.","en":"That cost us a fortune.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to cost","l":"kosten"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Mein Fehler kostete mich mein Vermögen.","en":"My mistake cost me my fortune.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"fault, error, mistake"},{"g":"to cost","l":"kosten"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Mein Vater hat mir ein großes Vermögen hinterlassen.","en":"My father left me a large fortune.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44904","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"groß"},null,{"g":"to leave"}]}]}